				<wikidot:authorName>Skadooshbag</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4470625</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Love it. I kinda always felt like the classification tiers were weirdly named, like the Foundation just picked words from Ancient Greek or Latin at random, especially since they suddenly changed their mind and decided to go about it like any real organization would when it came to the &quot;safe&quot; designation. What, was &quot;anthos,&quot; the Greek word for flower, already taken by the Horizon Initiative or something?</p> 
				 	]]>
